{"name": "Seferia Matrix", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/a4d69176fb97abd1dbd6565fbc17212d.poster.avif?t=1794229500\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/a4d69176fb97abd1dbd6565fbc17212d.webm?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/a4d69176fb97abd1dbd6565fbc17212d.mp4?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Three Schools, two kinds of Mage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each School pursues a different path of magic. From Mages who fight with spells to Battle Mages who blend close combat with magic, forge your own path across six modes. And don't worry \u2014 at the Seferia academy, you're always free to take any course from any School.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to the academy of magic in Seferia, the arcane superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"166\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c2837b81eaede1b0ab192870c8b174d6.poster.avif?t=1794229500\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c2837b81eaede1b0ab192870c8b174d6.webm?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c2837b81eaede1b0ab192870c8b174d6.mp4?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roll the dice to cast your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lock &amp; Roll your dice to build the hand that casts the spell you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c3496e4e420363a6257042d30c7842eb.poster.avif?t=1794229500\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c3496e4e420363a6257042d30c7842eb.webm?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/c3496e4e420363a6257042d30c7842eb.mp4?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine Artifacts to empower your spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mix and match over 100 Artifacts to customize a mage that's entirely your own. With the power of Artifacts behind them, your spells can deal outrageously amplified damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"166\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/8889b8c6c5413230616d1cad4b93f5e9.poster.avif?t=1794229500\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/8889b8c6c5413230616d1cad4b93f5e9.webm?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/8889b8c6c5413230616d1cad4b93f5e9.mp4?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use Sigils to create more possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dozens of different Sigils are powerful tools that let a mage turn the tables at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"394\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/e48e9938ec3fcebe048b1681369e3b3c.poster.avif?t=1794229500\" width=\"700\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/e48e9938ec3fcebe048b1681369e3b3c.webm?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4515500/extras/e48e9938ec3fcebe048b1681369e3b3c.mp4?t=1794229500\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Power up every run \u2014 and grow stronger across runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run offers countless upgrade choices that let you walk your own path of magic. And even if you flunk out, don't worry: the effort you put in builds up as permanent upgrades, run after run, shaping you into an ever more powerful mage.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dice roguelike deckbuilder \u2014 Lock & Roll five dice to cast spells and explode your damage with 300+ upgrades!", 